<title>THAILAND: Thai sugar vessels movement.</title>
<headline>Thai sugar vessels movement.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Independent surveyors detailed sugar vessels movement as follows:</p>
<p> Vessel	    Position	 Amount    Destination    Buyer</p>
<p>					 (tonnes)</p>
<p> Xin An Jiang     08/11/96	13,100    Indonesia	Kerry</p>
<p> Orient ExpressI  05/11/96	 1,000    Cambodia	 Kerry</p>
<p> Orient ExpressI ETA11/11/96     1,200    Indonesia  Tate&amp;Lyle</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
